    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a8ab37d4c8239d4926574c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请您一定要期待我！\n我会拼尽全力！等到那一天，我希望您能……多多表扬我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa417c4bd4b7fc49fe72aa535d65170f7eb5d11061a89eeee4f805fa9d5d805a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbef14632e752a088b94f6bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，多旺达成为了我的骑士。\n她是忠诚的骑士，但也是——一个渴望被认可、被表扬的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "853a548e52ac85febeb958e82b4a30772dbb6dfaee442b6202e8c673cccd95c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2a62ee6845a11c870184de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多旺达",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c409e22872af3fab02c98efd80664f501d1f4c1d317efbefe1ec70454942d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d16110108e9704d22ff23332",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您比我自己还相信我的能力啊。\n这双腿中蕴含的『圣剑』。——既然如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8492d306eb4d90a951755d0ad5c0c1021569153bf9467b6e4489028accdf7f14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d2bafd809cdae25c6005f45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拥有“持久力”的信念 vs 拥有“锋芒”的多旺达。\n一场追赶实力更胜一筹赛马娘的战斗开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096e7a53cdf13af4377b7a74d5b7408176b05f197ee912f6987e80a99019117b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df95ca1048c85cd95d46d15c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多旺达",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c409e22872af3fab02c98efd80664f501d1f4c1d317efbefe1ec70454942d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
