    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5221ce900eb3db8f828a558d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信念",
      "source_fingerprint": "babc42f10899ba2983c282d2f8342f6be76bc34bf88a966dcd72326d68a1269d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:821d5fe41f104405952ede34",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不需要花招，也不需要勉强加速。\n只需要――提升平均速度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01b6833d8a63271add1a50e3a484604808835ef68cfb489c1c917e6863ba05fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cfdca4c00676e59af39e959",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "骑士授任仪式！我之王乃大器，并且……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac61163d756f5be97b8143c520ec9d43c6ba18e40380d70a54ccc6e8d3869ca2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b9d71ba4ab8f783246e61f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自从成为多旺达的训练员已经过去了一段时间。\n我们共同协作的日子一直进展顺利——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1462a7a99918002074ba160b2b401f87bcebdc670a2f1d3bc5db2abb8171074f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
