    {
      "uid": "zhcn:839d3477cd1af9d3a8ba9817",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的——我发誓。从今日起，我将成为您的骑士，\n誓死捍卫您。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a39307080e1ac31772e08cae135d7444cce115d29b199ec5287e84beec1595e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3dcb179735fcc570e9c9598",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自从那天举行了骑士授任仪式以来，\n她一直以忠诚的骑士身份为我奉献。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c050ed4e6c02de951f99420aa49e6e9dac1e5ad3a95ab3fc7bb64a52e8884c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67e2848e7865ac0b990b74d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了与她那高洁的姿态相称，\n我也必须更加自豪地前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88a258aefc1873ad0117696a177c5bb335fc0b916ebf2eaaf2ff346cfcb9513b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121005.json",
      "json_path": [
